WEBVTT

00:01:29.043 --> 00:01:31.379
But I want you to know
I haven't stopped dreaming.

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:33.256
Neither have those girls of SOLA.

00:01:34.549 --> 00:01:37.718
We have taken our dreams and adapted them.

00:01:38.636 --> 00:01:43.432
Agility, adaptation, resilience.

00:01:44.016 --> 00:01:47.478
These concepts are core
to everything that SOLA is.

00:01:48.479 --> 00:01:52.400
We have faced the uncertainty
of what might be,

00:01:52.441 --> 00:01:55.611
and we have turned it
into the certainty of what will be.

00:01:55.653 --> 00:01:56.821
I'll explain.

00:01:57.530 --> 00:01:59.699
Back in 2012,

00:01:59.699 --> 00:02:02.535
we ran a program
where girls lived at SOLA